    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">providesSupportFor</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The from Agent provides support for each to Artifact. The use of the providesSupportFor type is constrained to SupportRelationship classed relationships.</rdfs:comment>
