  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/key">
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">key</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A key used in a generic key-value pair.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A key used in a generic key-value pair.</skos:definition>
    <skos:note xml:lang="en">A key used in generic a key-value pair.

A key-value pair can be used to implement a dictionary which associates a key
with a value.</skos:note>
