    <skos:note xml:lang="en">A ModifyProcess is a process that will result in the alteration of a product, such as a change to its configuration or its location.

Relationship:

For each ModifyProcess there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'hasOutput’ on the from and a /Core/Element subclass on the to.

For each ModifyProcess there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'hasInput’ on the from and a /Core/Element subclass on the to.</skos:note>
