Relationship:

For each UseAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'performedBy’ on the from and a /Core/Agent class or subclass on the to.

For each UseAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'affects’ on the from and a /Core/Element class or subclass on the to.</skos:note>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/Action"/>
