    <skos:note xml:lang="en">A typeFromSource is a specific term or label assigned within a definitionSource to define or identify an item, concept, or category.
It represents a unique or standardized value within the classification system that helps categorize and describe the item's place or characteristics within the overall definitionSource.</skos:note>
