Element can be asserted.

Please note that different profiles may also provide additional methods for
verifying the integrity of specific subclasses of Elements.</skos:note>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/IntegrityMethod"/>
