    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">diskImage</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Element refers to a disk image that can be written to a disk, booted in a VM, etc. A disk image typically contains most or all of the components necessary to boot, such as bootloaders, kernels, firmware, userspace, etc.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Element refers to a disk image that can be written to a disk, booted in a VM, etc. A disk image typically contains most or all of the components necessary to boot, such as bootloaders, kernels, firmware, userspace, etc.</skos:definition>
  </owl:NamedIndividual>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/plannedStorageLocation">
