Core profile.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A concrete subclass of Element used by Individuals in the
Core profile.</skos:definition>
    <skos:note xml:lang="en">Individuals, such as NoneElement and NoAssertionElement, need to reference a
concrete subclass of Element.

This class provides the type used by the individuals defined in the Core profile.</skos:note>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/Element"/>
    <sh:nodeKind rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI"/>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/AI/metric">
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/AI"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">metric</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Metric used to evaluate the AI model.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Metric used to evaluate the AI model.</skos:definition>
    <skos:note xml:lang="en">Metric used to evaluate the AI model.

This makes statements about the prediction quality including uncertainty,
accuracy, characteristics of the tested population, quality, fairness,
explainability, robustness etc.</skos:note>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/DictionaryEntry"/>
