    <skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[A reference to a published security advisory (where advisory as defined per ISO 29147:2018 <https://www.iso.org/standard/72311.html>) that may affect one or more elements, e.g., vendor advisories or specific NVD entries.]]></skos:definition>
  </owl:NamedIndividual>
