  <owl:Class rdf:about="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/TestProcess">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape"/>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">TestProcess</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Test Process defines the testing process for an element.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Test Process defines the testing process for an element.</skos:definition>
    <skos:note xml:lang="en">Tests are processes based on requirements. The process's requirements are met by the test process.

Relationship:

For each TestProcess there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'contains’ on the from and a Requirements class or subclass on the to.</skos:note>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/UseProcess"/>
