    <skos:note xml:lang="en">A PlanAction involves the execution of a plan in relation to a PlanProcess.

The description of the PlanAction is a mandatory property.

Relationship:

For each PlanAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'generates’ on the to and a PlanProcess class or subclass on the from.</skos:note>
