    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">bic</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Business Identifier Code (BIC), also known as SWIFT-BIC or SWIFT code, is a unique 8 or 11-character alphanumeric code standardized by ISO 9362 <https://www.iso.org/standard/84108.html> to identify financial and non-financial institutions (e.g., BBWCUS33).]]></rdfs:comment>
