external to that SpdxDocument.</skos:definition>
    <skos:note xml:lang="en">An external map is a map of Element identifiers that are used within an
SpdxDocument but defined external to that SpdxDocument.
The external map provides details about the externally-defined Element
such as its provenance, where to retrieve it, and how to verify its integrity.</skos:note>
    <sh:nodeKind rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#BlankNodeOrIRI"/>
