    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">analyzed</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">SBOM generated through analysis of artifacts (e.g., executables, packages, containers, and virtual machine images) after its build. Such analysis generally requires a variety of heuristics. In some contexts, this may also be referred to as a "3rd party" SBOM.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">SBOM generated through analysis of artifacts (e.g., executables, packages, containers, and virtual machine images) after its build. Such analysis generally requires a variety of heuristics. In some contexts, this may also be referred to as a "3rd party" SBOM.</skos:definition>
  </owl:NamedIndividual>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Security/decisionType">
