    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">endOfSupport</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">There is a defined end of support for the artifact from the supplier. This may also be referred to as end of life. There is a validUntilDate that can be used to signal when support ends for the artifact.</rdfs:comment>
