    <skos:note xml:lang="en">The development lifecycle stage specifies the phase or phases of a product’s lifecycle to which a given requirement applies. These may include requirements that govern the design phase, guide development activities, define constraints for the build environment, provide instructions for the decommissioning phase, etc.</skos:note>
