    <skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[A reference to a Maven repository artifact. The artifact locator format is defined in the Maven documentation <https://maven.apache.org/guides/mini/guide-naming-conventions.html> and looks like groupId:artifactId[:version].]]></skos:definition>
  </owl:NamedIndividual>
