    <skos:note xml:lang="en">This field is a reasonable estimation of the content type of the Element or the
property, from a creator perspective.

Content type is intrinsic to the Element or the property, independent of how it
is being used.</skos:note>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
