    <skos:note xml:lang="en">A value used in a key-value pair with a generic key that refers to an Element.

A key-value pair can be used to implement a dictionary which associates a key
with an Element.</skos:note>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/Element"/>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
