    <skos:note xml:lang="en">CreatedUsing identifies the tooling that was used during the creation of the
Element.

The generation method will assist the recipient of the Element in assessing
the general reliability/accuracy of the analysis information.</skos:note>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/Tool"/>
